.TH "epiphany" "1" "May 2025" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
epiphany \- A simple, clean, beautiful view of the web
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBepiphany\fP [\fIOPTION\fP\&...] [\fIURL\fP\&...]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBepiphany\fP is the codename of GNOME Web, the web browser designed for the
GNOME desktop. It offers first\-class GNOME integration, using WebKitGTK for web
rendering.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-new\-window\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Open a new browser window instead of a new tab
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-l\fP, \fB\-\-load\-session\fP=\fIFILE\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Load the given session state file
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-i\fP, \fB\-\-incognito\-mode\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Start an instance with read\-only user data, for browsing without storing history on your computer
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-p\fP, \fB\-\-private\-instance\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Start a temporary instance without any user data, for testing
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-a\fP, \fB\-\-application\-mode\fP=\fIBASENAME\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Start a private instance in web application mode (requires passing either desktop file basename or \fB\-\-profile\fP)
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-automation\-mode\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Start a private instance for WebDriver control
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-profile\fP=\fIFILE\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Start using a custom profile directory for user data
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-search\fP=\fITERM\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Initiate search with given search term
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-?\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show help options
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\-\-version\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Show version
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Epiphany has a comprehensive help system.  Run the browser
and select \fBHelp\fP from the menu.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
Epiphany has been developed by Marco Pesenti Gritti (in memoriam),
Christian Persch, Xan Lopez, Carlos Garcia Campos, Claudio Saavedra,
Michael Catanzaro, Jan\-Michael Brummer, Alice Mikhaylenko,
Patrick Griffis, and many others.
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
Copyright 2006-2025 GNOME Foundation
